#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:50
msgid ""
"Allow both supervisors to reach the database and each other's actor, binlog and "
"checkpoint ports. Nginx must reach both supervisor APIs. Workers must reach the "
"primary API, and both supervisors must reach worker actor ports. Do not use loopback "
"addresses for communication between hosts."
msgstr ""
"Autorisez les deux supervisors à joindre la base de données ainsi que les ports "
"actor, binlog et checkpoint l'un de l'autre. Nginx doit pouvoir joindre les API des "
"deux supervisors. Les workers doivent pouvoir joindre l'API du primaire, et les deux "
"supervisors doivent pouvoir joindre les ports actor des workers. N'utilisez pas "
"d'adresses de bouclage pour la communication entre hôtes."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:53
msgid "Prepare the database and nodes"
msgstr "Préparer la base de données et les nœuds"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:55
msgid ""
"Both supervisors must use the same shared database, not separate local SQLite "
"databases. The database stores API, permission, task and instance records; binlog and"
" checkpoint synchronize supervisor runtime metadata. These mechanisms have different "
"responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"Les deux supervisors doivent utiliser la même base de données partagée, et non des "
"bases SQLite locales distinctes. La base de données stocke les enregistrements d'API,"
" d'autorisations, de tâches et d'instances ; binlog et checkpoint synchronisent les "
"métadonnées d'exécution des supervisors. Ces mécanismes ont des responsabilités "
"différentes."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:57
msgid ""
"Configure one database URL on both supervisors. Using the same configuration on "
"workers keeps the environment consistent. The image must include the corresponding "
"database driver."
msgstr ""
"Configurez une même URL de base de données sur les deux supervisors. Utiliser la même"
" configuration sur les workers garantit la cohérence de l'environnement. L'image doit"
" inclure le pilote de base de données correspondant."

