#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:73
msgid ""
"Confirm the supervisor and worker commands exist, inspect the supervisor's supported "
"options, and choose the working directory used by the image."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez que les commandes supervisor et worker existent, examinez les options prises"
" en charge par le supervisor et choisissez le répertoire de travail utilisé par "
"l'image."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:82
msgid ""
"Before starting processes, check the ports allocated to that node. For the secondary "
"use ports 9992, 9912, 9552 and 9652; for the worker use port 9921."
msgstr ""
"Avant de démarrer les processus, vérifiez les ports attribués à ce nœud. Pour le "
"secondaire, utilisez les ports 9992, 9912, 9552 et 9652 ; pour le worker, utilisez le"
" port 9921."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:84
msgid "Primary-node port check"
msgstr "Vérification des ports du nœud primaire"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:101
msgid "Start the cluster"
msgstr "Démarrer le cluster"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:103
msgid ""
"Run each command on its designated node, after exporting the shared database URL. "
"Logs are written to the working directory."
msgstr ""
"Exécutez chaque commande sur le nœud qui lui est attribué, après avoir exporté l'URL "
"de la base de données partagée. Les journaux sont écrits dans le répertoire de "
"travail."

